EV-3413.3", "C-341-3 compressor capacity control", "Solenoid valve", "—", "PR36", "DANFOSS BZ240C P/N 018F4704 · DO 230 VAC · Ex mb"], ["ZEV-3413.4", "C-341-4 compressor capacity control", "Solenoid valve", "—", "PR37", "DANFOSS BZ240C P/N 018F4704 · DO 230 VAC · Ex mb"], ["ZEV-3414.1", "C-341-1 compressor capacity control", "Solenoid valve", "—", "PR34", "DANFOSS BZ240C P/N 018F4704 · DO 230 VAC · Ex mb"], ["ZEV-3414.2", "C-341-2 compressor capacity control", "Solenoid valve", "—", "PR35", "DANFOSS BZ240C P/N 018F4704 · DO 230 VAC · Ex mb"], ["ZEV-3414.3", "C-341-3 compressor capacity control", "Solenoid valve", "—", "PR36", "DANFOSS BZ240C P/N 018F4704 · DO 230 VAC · Ex mb"], ["ZEV-3414.4", "C-341-4 compressor capacity control", "Solenoid valve", "—", "PR37", "DANFOSS BZ240C P/N 018F4704 · DO 230 VAC · Ex mb"]], "foot": "37 plant_valves records for unit 340 plus PCV-3402, which the registry keeps in plant_instruments (its plant_valve_assets row does exist). SET PRESSURES ARE MOSTLY FREE TEXT: only PSV-3401A/B carry a numeric inst_range; every other PSV set pressure lives in the notes column, and the two control-valve set pressures the P&ID shows (PCV-3401 at 25.45 barg, PCV-3402 at 24.7 barg) are absent from the database altogether. plant_valve_assets.fail_action, actuator_type and valve_size are null on all 42 rows, so no fail-safe position can be stated. All rows are review_status NEEDS_REVIEW. ZEV-3414.2 has a valve record and an asset record but no I/O channel. OPEN (A-17): the register cites PR38 as the drawing for PEV-3401, but PR38 rev 8 shows NO solenoid, no S box and no interlock on PCV-3401, which is drawn as a purely self-acting regulator; PEV-3401 also has no plant_io_list channel. Two independent absences — the row is printed as the register holds it and the disagreement is reported, not resolved. Verification requested from ITALFLUID / TAM."}, "alarms": {"title": "Alarms & Trips · Unit 340 (60)", "cols": ["Alarm", "Initiator", "Type", "Set point", "Description"], "rows": [["LAL-3401", "LT-3401", "ALARM", "25 %", "Low level - receiver V-343"], ["PAH-3401", "PT-3401", "ALARM", "27 barg", "High pressure - receiver V-343"], ["PAL-3401", "PT-3401", "ALARM", "20 barg", "Low pressure - receiver V-343"], ["PAH-3411.1", "PT-3411.1", "ALARM", "5 bara", "High pressure - compressor suction"], ["PAH-3411.2", "PT-3411.2", "ALARM", "5 bara", "High pressure - compressor suction"], ["PAH-3411.3", "PT-3411.3", "ALARM", "5 bara", "High pressure - compressor suction"], ["PAH-3411.4", "PT-3411.4", "ALARM", "5 bara", "High pressure - compressor suction"], ["PAL-3411.1", "PT-3411.1", "ALARM", "2.5 bara", "Low pressure - compressor suction"], ["PAL-3411.2", "PT-3411.2", "ALARM", "2.5 bara", "Low pressure - compressor suction"], ["PAL-3411.3", "PT-3411.3", "ALARM", "2.5 bara", "Low pressure - compressor suction"], ["PAL-3411.4", "PT-3411.4", "ALARM", "2.5 bara", "Low pressure - compressor suction"], ["PALL-3411.1", "PT-3411.1", "LSD", "1.5 bara", "Low low suction pressure"], ["PALL-3411.2", "PT-3411.2", "LSD", "1.5 bara", "Low low suction pressure"], ["PALL-3411.3", "PT-3411.3", "LSD", "1.5 bara", "Low low suction pressure"], ["PALL-3411.4", "PT-3411.4", "LSD", "1.5 bara", "Low low suction pressure"], ["PAH-3412.1", "PT-3412.1", "ALARM", "27 barg", "High pressure - oil separator / discharge"], ["PAH-3412.2", "PT-3412.2", "ALARM", "27 barg", "High pressure - oil separator / discharge"], ["PAH-3412.3", "PT-3412.3", "ALARM", "27 barg", "High pressure - oil separator / discharge"], ["PAH-3412.4", "PT-3412.4", "ALARM", "27 barg", "High pressure - oil separator / discharge"], ["PAHH-3412.1", "PT-3412.1", "LSD", "27.5 barg", "High high discharge pressure"], ["PAHH-3412.2", "PT-3412.2", "LSD", "27.5 barg", "High high discharge pressure"], ["PAHH-3412.3", "PT-3412.3", "LSD", "27.5 barg", "High high discharge pressure"], ["PAHH-3412.4", "PT-3412.4", "LSD", "27.5 barg", "High high discharge pressure"], ["PDAL-3414.1", "PDT-3414.1", "ALARM", "1.5 bar", "Low diff. pressure - lube oil differential"], ["PDAL-3414.2", "PDT-3414.2", "ALARM", "1.5 bar", "Low diff. pressure - lube oil differential"], ["PDAL-3414.3", "PDT-3414.3", "ALARM", "1.5 bar", "Low diff. pressure - lube oil differential"], ["PDAL-3414.4", "PDT-3414.4", "ALARM", "1.5 bar", "Low diff. pressure - lube oil differential"], ["PDALL-3414.1", "PDT-3414.1", "LSD", "1 bar", "Low low oil differential pressure"], ["PDALL-3414.2", "PDT-3414.2", "LSD", "1 bar", "Low low oil differential pressure"], ["PDALL-3414.3", "PDT-3414.3", "LSD", "1 bar", "Low low oil differential pressure"], ["PDALL-3414.4", "PDT-3414.4", "LSD", "1 bar", "Low low oil differential pressure"], ["TAH-3412.1", "TT-3412.1", "ALARM", "105 °C", "High temperature - compressor discharge"], ["TAH-3412.2", "TT-3412.2", "ALARM", "105 °C", "High temperature - compressor discharge"], ["TAH-3412.3", "TT-3412.3", "ALARM", "105 °C", "High temperature - compressor discharge"], ["TAH-3412.4", "TT-3412.4", "ALARM", "105 °C", "High temperature - compressor discharge"], ["TAHH-3412.1", "TT-3412.1", "LSD", "110 °C", "High high discharge temperature"], ["TAHH-3412.2", "TT-3412.2", "LSD", "110 °C", "High high discharge temperature"], ["TAHH-3412.3", "TT-3412.3", "LSD", "110 °C", "High high discharge temperature"], ["TAHH-3412.4", "TT-3412.4", "LSD", "110 °C", "High high discharge temperature"], ["TAL-3418.1", "TT-3418.1", "ALARM", "25 °C", "Low temperature - oil filter outlet"], ["TAL-3418.2", "TT-3418.2", "ALARM", "25 °C", "Low temperature - oil filter outlet"], ["TAL-3418.3", "TT-3418.3", "ALARM", "25 °C", "Low temperature - oil filter outlet"], ["TAL-3418.4", "TT-3418.4", "ALARM", "25 °C", "Low temperature - oil filter outlet"], ["TAH-3418.1", "TT-3418.1", "ALARM", "60 °C", "High temperature - oil filter outlet"], ["TAH-3418.2", "TT-3418.2", "ALARM", "60 °C", "High temperature - oil filter outlet"], ["TAH-3418.3", "TT-3418.3", "ALARM", "60 °C", "High temperature - oil filter outlet"], ["TAH-3418.4", "TT-3418.4", "ALARM", "60 °C", "High temperature - oil filter outlet"], ["TAHH-3418.1", "TT-3418.1", "LSD", "65 °C", "High high oil temp on oil header"], ["TAHH-3418.2", "TT-3418.2", "LSD", "65 °C", "High high oil temp on oil header"], ["TAHH-3418.3", "TT-3418.3", "LSD", "65 °C", "High high oil temp on oil header"], ["TAHH-3418.4", "TT-3418.4", "LSD", "65 °C", "High high oil temp on oil header"], ["TAHH-3419.1", "TT-3419.1", "LSD", "—", "High high temperature on C-341-1 suction"], ["TAHH-3419.2", "TT-3419.2", "LSD", "—", "High high temperature on C-341-2 suction"], ["TAHH-3419.3", "TT-3419.3", "LSD", "—", "High high temperature on C-341-3 suction"], ["TAHH-3419.4", "TT-3419.4", "LSD", "—", "High high temperature on C-341-4 suction"], ["ST341-1", "ST341-1", "ALARM", "DI (discrete)", "Isolated-barrier JB high temperature - master alarm"], ["ST341-2", "ST341-2", "ALARM", "DI (discrete)", "Isolated-barrier JB high temperature - master alarm"], ["ST341-3", "ST341-3", "ALARM", "DI (discrete)", "Isolated-barrier JB high temperature - master alarm"], ["ST341-4", "ST341-4", "ALARM", "DI (discrete)", "Isolated-barrier JB high temperature - master alarm"], ["XAHH-3401", "GD-05…GD-09 (2ooN)", "PSD", "DI", "Ammonia gas detection - process shutdown"]], "foot": "All 60 plant_alarms records for area 340, printed with the type each row carries. The extract also states a breakdown of 39 ALARM / 20 LSD / 1 PSD, but the per-tag table marks 24 rows LSD (PALL-3411.x, PAHH-3412.x, PDALL-3414.x, TAHH-3412.x, TAHH-3418.x, TAHH-3419.x) - an internal inconsistency in the source that is reported, not reconciled. The alarm register names PDT-3414.1…4 as the instrument behind eight rows, and no such device exists in plant_instruments, plant_assets, plant_io_list or plant_measuring_points - because there is no such device. The vendor package manual states it: the differential is PDI-3414.1, CALCULATED in the PLC as PT-3413.1 - PT-3412.1, and it is displayed on the compressor HMI in BarD. Both transmitters are registered and both are wired, so THE LUBE-OIL DIFFERENTIAL TRIP IS TRACEABLE END TO END; what is wrong is the instrument name in the alarm register, which should read PDI-3414.x. TAHH-3419.1…4 have null set points. SET-POINT CONFLICT ON THE OIL TRIP: manual Table 7.10 gives PDALL-3414.x at 1.5, and manual §7.7.7 and Table 7.13 use the same 1.5 bar for the start permissive and for tripping a running machine; the database splits the figure into PDAL-3414.x 1.5 bar (alarm) and PDALL-3414.x 1 bar (trip). The database values are printed above. Manual Table 7.10 also leaves TAHH-3418.x blank, where the database gives 65 °C. The 5 gas detectors GD-05…GD-09 (PK-341-1…4 and V-343, drawing SAF11-ING-FR01) sit in plant_safety_devices only - they are not plant_assets, so they appear in no discipline square. The same table holds 5 SAFETY-class fire assets for the area: 2 extinguishers, 1 alarm pushbutton (status REMOVED), 1 emergency shower, 1 spillage kit."}, "loops": {"title": "Control loops · R1 cycle (1 in area 340 + 3 in neighbouring areas)", "cols": ["Loop", "Duty", "Final element", "Range", "SP", "Registered in area"], "rows": [["PIC-3401", "V-343 ammonia receiver pressure control - on/off staging of the E-342 condenser fan motors with hysteresis", "E-342", "0..28 barg", "—", "340"], ["LIC-3111", "E-311 ammonia liquid level - maintains ammonia level in the E-311 shell", "LV-3111", "0..100 %", "—", "310 (R1 user, not area 340)"], ["LIC-3540", "E-354 refrigerant (NH3) liquid level - maintains ammonia level in the E-354 shell", "LV-3540", "0..100 %", "—", "350 (R1 user, not area 340)"], ["PIC-3552", "R1 evaporating / suction pressure at the E-354 outlet - signal to the PK-341 packages, which modulate slide-valve capacity", "— (null in the DB)", "0..34.47 barg", "—", "350 (R1 cascade master, not area 340)"]], "foot": "PIC-3401 is the ONLY control-loop record the database holds inside area 340. The other three rows belong to the same R1 cycle but are registered in neighbouring areas and are marked as such. set_point is null on all four, so the manual Table 7.9 figure of SP 25 barg for PIC-3401 can be neither confirmed nor refuted from the registry. PIC-3552 additionally has a null final_control_element, although plant_pid_connectors carries an explicit Signal from PIC-3552 inbound connector on all four package P&IDs. There is no loop record for the PCV-3401 / PCV-3402 pair, no per-compressor capacity loop and no oil-temperature loop; the manual tags PI-3411.x, PIC-3411.x and PIC-3433.x are not in the database at all - yet PIC-3411.1 and TIC-3417.1 are live faceplates on the compressor HMI (Manual Fig. 7.3), so the loops are real and the REGISTRY is the incomplete source. PDI-3414.x is absent for a different reason: it is a PLC calculation (PT-3413.x - PT-3412.x), not a device, so no instrument row is expected. v_loop_trace returns control_loops null on all 83 unit-340 rows."}, "motors": {"title": "Motors & electrical loads · Unit 340 (120 motors · 112 on the remote MCC)", "cols": ["Tag", "Service", "Drive / start", "Rating", "Source"], "rows": [["MC-341-1…4", "Ammonia compressor motors C-341-1…4 · ABB M3GP 355LKB 2 · 2983 rpm · 535 A · IE4 · Ex ec IIC T3 Gc", "VFD", "690 V · 560.0 kW each", "plant_electrical_assets"], ["MP-341-1…4", "Oil pump motors P-341-1…4 · Siemens 1MB10x3-1BB2 · 1460 rpm · 4.6 A · IE3", "DOL", "690 V · 4.0 kW each", "plant_electrical_assets"], ["MF-341-1-1…10", "Oil cooler fan motors E-341-1 · panel JG-341-1C · slots A1…A10", "DOL", "400 V · 4.0 kW each", "plant_mcc_motors"], ["MF-341-2-1…10", "Oil cooler fan motors E-341-2 · panel JG-341-2C · slots A1…A10", "DOL", "400 V · 4.0 kW each", "plant_mcc_motors"], ["MF-341-3-1…10", "Oil cooler fan motors E-341-3 · panel JG-341-3C · slots A1…A10", "DOL", "400 V · 4.0 kW each", "plant_mcc_motors"], ["MF-341-4-1…10", "Oil cooler fan motors E-341-4 · panel JG-341-4C · slots A1…A10", "DOL", "400 V · 4.0 kW each", "plant_mcc_motors"], ["MF-342-1-1…12", "Ammonia condenser fan motors E-342-1 · panel JG-342-1 · slots A1…A12", "DOL", "400 V · 4.0 kW each", "plant_mcc_motors"], ["MF-342-2-1…12", "Ammonia condenser fan motors E-342-2 · panel JG-342-2 · slots A1…A12", "DOL", "400 V · 4.0 kW each", "plant_mcc_motors"], ["MF-342-3-1…12", "Ammonia condenser fan motors E-342-3 · panel JG-342-3 · slots A1…A12", "DOL", "400 V · 4.0 kW each", "plant_mcc_motors"], ["MF-342-4-1…12", "Ammonia condenser fan motors E-342-4 · panel JG-342-4 · slots A1…A12", "DOL", "400 V · 4.0 kW each", "plant_mcc_motors"], ["MF-342-5-1…12", "Ammonia condenser fan motors E-342-5 · panel JG-342-5 · slots A1…A12", "DOL", "400 V · 4.0 kW each", "plant_mcc_motors"], ["MF-342-6-1…12", "Ammonia condenser fan motors E-342-6 · panel JG-342-6 · slots A1…A12", "DOL", "400 V · 4.0 kW each", "plant_mcc_motors"], ["E-341-1…4 (bank)", "Oil cooler fan bank feeders (10 × 4 kW each)", "Circuit breaker", "400 V · 40.0 kW each", "plant_electrical_loads"], ["E-342-1…6 (bank)", "Ammonia condenser fan bank feeders (12 × 4 kW each)", "Circuit breaker", "400 V · 48.0 kW each", "plant_electrical_loads"], ["X-341-1…4", "Oil separator oil heaters (resistive, energised only when the compressor is stopped)", "DOL", "690 V · 5.3 kW each", "plant_electrical_loads"]], "foot": "120 plant_electrical_assets rows = 4 compressor motors + 4 oil-pump motors + 40 oil-cooler fan motors + 72 condenser fan motors; 112 of them are Remote-MCC records in plant_mcc_motors (MC-341-x and MP-341-x are VFD/feeder loads, not MCC starters). VOLTAGE CONFLICT: the database says 400 V for every fan motor - in plant_electrical_assets, in plant_electrical_loads and in the Seipee JM 112Ma 4 model spec - and so does P&ID PR34-PR37; manual Tables 7.5 and 7.4 say 690 V. The DB value is printed. FAN COUNT: 12 per condenser here (72 motors, slots A1…A12), which agrees with the manual; the plant_equipment note for E-342-x and P&ID PR38 rev 8 both say 18 each. RATINGS: the DB gives oil pump 4.00 kW and oil heater 5.30 kW - the reverse of manual Table 7.4 - and three DB tables agree, one of them breaking 5.30 kW down as 5.175 kW element plus 0.125 kW fan. A residual DB inconsistency: PR34 drawing notes state X-341-1 at 3 × 0.75 kW (2.25 kW), matching neither figure. Fan speed is 1410 rpm in the motor model spec and 1450 rpm on the P&ID. plant_feeders and plant_switchboards hold no unit-340 rows, so only MP-341-1…4 have an upstream feeder link (480-JG-693-F347…F350)."}, "jbs": {"title": "Junction boxes & PROFINET heads · Unit 340 (9)", "cols": ["Tag", "Service", "System"], "rows": [["P-PK-PK-341-1", "Ammonia compressor package 1 · CMC EJB-H · Ex db [ia Ga] IIB T6 / Ex tb [ia Da] IIIC T85C · IP66 · Zone 1/21 · Siemens ET200SP SIPLUS IM155-6 PN ST · PROFINET ring to MSC.10 · 230 VAC + 24 VDC 10 A", "PCS"], ["P-PK-PK-341-2", "Ammonia compressor package 2 · CMC EJB-H · Ex db [ia Ga] IIB T6 / Ex tb [ia Da] IIIC T85C · IP66 · Zone 1/21 · Siemens ET200SP SIPLUS IM155-6 PN ST · PROFINET ring to MSC.10 · 230 VAC + 24 VDC 10 A", "PCS"], ["P-PK-PK-341-3", "Ammonia compressor package 3 · CMC EJB-H · Ex db [ia Ga] IIB T6 / Ex tb [ia Da] IIIC T85C · IP66 · Zone 1/21 · Siemens ET200SP SIPLUS IM155-6 PN ST · PROFINET ring to MSC.10 · 230 VAC + 24 VDC 10 A", "PCS"], ["P-PK-PK-341-4", "Ammonia compressor package 4 · CMC EJB-H · Ex db [ia Ga] IIB T6 / Ex tb [ia Da] IIIC T85C · IP66 · Zone 1/21 · Siemens ET200SP SIPLUS IM155-6 PN ST · PROFINET ring to MSC.10 · 230 VAC + 24 VDC 10 A", "PCS"], ["P-PN-PK341-1", "PROFINET head named by the plant_instruments records of package 1 · counted as a RIO panel, no plant_jb record", "PCS"], ["P-PN-PK341-2", "PROFINET head named by the plant_instruments records of package 2 · counted as a RIO panel, no plant_jb record", "PCS"], ["P-PN-PK341-3", "PROFINET head named by the plant_instruments records of package 3 · counted as a RIO panel, no plant_jb record", "PCS"], ["P-PN-PK341-4", "PROFINET head named by the plant_instruments records of package 4 · counted as a RIO panel, no plant_jb record", "PCS"], ["P-PN-OV351.1", "Common system junction box - PT-3401, LT-3401, PEV-3401, PEV-3402 on the ammonia receiver V-343 · no plant_jb record and no I/O channel list", "PCS"]], "foot": "plant_jb describes only the four package panels P-PK-PK-341-1…4 (610 × 832 × 412 mm, 81 W dissipation, -20 to +50 °C, module layout A0 IM155-6 / A1 AI 8x / A2 DI 16x24 VDC / A3 DQ 4x24 VDC 2 A / A4 RQ 4x120 VDC-230 VAC 5 A, spares DI.9-15 plus DI.16 control-fuse monitor). The five tags counted as JUNCTION_BOX in the asset register are P-PK-PK-341-1…4 plus P-PN-OV351.1; the four P-PN-PK341-x heads are counted as RIO panels. P-PN-PK341-1…4 and P-PN-OV351.1 have NO plant_jb record - they exist only as the junction_box string on the instrument rows. Manual Table 7.8 lists the same set."}, "io": {"title": "IO channels · Unit 340 (83)", "cols": ["Package junction box", "AI (A1)", "DI (A2)", "DO 24 VDC (A3)", "DO 230 VAC (A4)", "Total"], "rows": [["P-PK-PK-341-1", "8", "6", "3", "4", "21"], ["P-PK-PK-341-2", "8", "6", "3", "3", "20"], ["P-PK-PK-341-3", "8", "6", "3", "4", "21"], ["P-PK-PK-341-4", "8", "6", "3", "4", "21"], ["TOTAL", "32", "24", "12", "15", "83"]], "foot": "Identical slot layout in each package junction box: A1 AI 8x2/4-wire - ch1 PT-3411.x, ch2 PT-3412.x, ch3 PT-3413.x, ch4 ZT-3411.x, ch5 TT-3419.x, ch6 TT-3412.x, ch7 TT-3417.x, ch8 TT-3418.x, all 4-20 mA. A2 DI 16x24 VDC - ch1 LSL-3417.x (NAMUR), ch2 HS-3411.x-LR, ch4 HS-3411.x-ST, ch5 HS-3411.x-TP, ch6 HS-3411.x-LSD, ch8 ST341-x, all dry contact. A3 DQ 4x24 VDC/2 A - ch1 XL-3411.x-RU, ch2 XL-3411.x-RE, ch3 XL-3411.x-AL. A4 RQ 4x120 VDC-230 VAC/5 A - ch5 ZEV-3411.x, ch6 ZEV-3412.x, ch7 ZEV-3413.x, ch8 ZEV-3414.x. TWO GAPS: package 2 is missing slot A4 channel 8, so ZEV-3414.2 has a valve record, an asset record and a plant_valve_assets row but NO I/O channel; and the common-system instruments PT-3401, LT-3401, PEV-3401 and PEV-3402 name junction box P-PN-OV351.1 but have no channel record at all. Drawing sources IE24090_SE05/SE06/SE07/SE08_P-PK-PK-341-x.pdf."}, "starters": {"title": "Local MCC / RIO panels · Unit 340 (10)", "cols": ["Panel", "Feeds", "Motors", "Slots", "Register"], "rows": [["JG-341-1C", "Oil cooler E-341-1 fan feeders", "MF-341-1-1…10 (10 × DOL, 400 V, 4.0 kW)", "A1…A10", "Local MCC panel (plant_functional_locations, NEEDS_REVIEW)"], ["JG-341-2C", "Oil cooler E-341-2 fan feeders", "MF-341-2-1…10 (10 × DOL, 400 V, 4.0 kW)", "A1…A10", "Local MCC panel (plant_functional_locations, NEEDS_REVIEW)"], ["JG-341-3C", "Oil cooler E-341-3 fan feeders", "MF-341-3-1…10 (10 × DOL, 400 V, 4.0 kW)", "A1…A10", "Local MCC panel (plant_functional_locations, NEEDS_REVIEW)"], ["JG-341-4C", "Oil cooler E-341-4 fan feeders", "MF-341-4-1…10 (10 × DOL, 400 V, 4.0 kW)", "A1…A10", "Local MCC panel (plant_functional_locations, NEEDS_REVIEW)"], ["JG-342-1", "Ammonia condenser E-342-1 fan feeders", "MF-342-1-1…12 (12 × DOL, 400 V, 4.0 kW)", "A1…A12", "Local MCC panel (plant_functional_locations, NEEDS_REVIEW)"], ["JG-342-2", "Ammonia condenser E-342-2 fan feeders", "MF-342-2-1…12 (12 × DOL, 400 V, 4.0 kW)", "A1…A12", "Local MCC panel (plant_functional_locations, NEEDS_REVIEW)"], ["JG-342-3", "Ammonia condenser E-342-3 fan feeders", "MF-342-3-1…12 (12 × DOL, 400 V, 4.0 kW)", "A1…A12", "Local MCC panel (plant_functional_locations, NEEDS_REVIEW)"], ["JG-342-4", "Ammonia condenser E-342-4 fan feeders", "MF-342-4-1…12 (12 × DOL, 400 V, 4.0 kW)", "A1…A12", "Local MCC panel (plant_functional_locations, NEEDS_REVIEW)"], ["JG-342-5", "Ammonia condenser E-342-5 fan feeders", "MF-342-5-1…12 (12 × DOL, 400 V, 4.0 kW)", "A1…A12", "Local MCC panel (plant_functional_locations, NEEDS_REVIEW)"], ["JG-342-6", "Ammonia condenser E-342-6 fan feeders", "MF-342-6-1…12 (12 × DOL, 400 V, 4.0 kW)", "A1…A12", "Local MCC panel (plant_functional_locations, NEEDS_REVIEW)"]], "foot": "Ten local MCC panels carry all 112 Remote-MCC fan motors, fail position Stop on every one. The asset register counts 14 RIO panels for the unit: these ten plus the four package PROFINET heads P-PN-PK341-1…4, which are listed under Junction boxes. Manual Table 7.8 adds that JG-342-1 is copper-fibre while the rest are copper-copper - not a database field. MC-341-x and MP-341-x are not on the remote MCC: the compressor motors are VFD loads and the oil-pump motors are 690 V feeders from area 480."}, "sequences": {"title": "Sequences · Unit 340 (8)", "cols": ["Tag", "Description", "Content held"], "rows": [["SQ3401", "Start sequence C-341-1", "tag and title only"], ["SQ3402", "Stop sequence C-341-1", "tag and title only"], ["SQ3403", "Start sequence C-341-2", "tag and title only"], ["SQ3404", "Stop sequence C-341-2", "tag and title only"], ["SQ3405", "Start sequence C-341-3", "tag and title only"], ["SQ3406", "Stop sequence C-341-3", "tag and title only"], ["SQ3407", "Start sequence C-341-4", "tag and title only"], ["SQ3408", "Stop sequence C-341-4", "tag and title only"]], "foot": "plant_sequences holds tag and description ONLY - SQ3401…SQ3408 carry no steps, no permissives, no timers and no interlock logic. The start-up and shutdown sequences of manual Tables 7.13 / 7.14 are not digitised; a sequence slide cannot be generated from the database."}, "mvalves": {"title": "Manual valves · Unit 340 (register not digitised)", "cols": ["Tag", "Class", "Type", "Size", "Line"], "rows": [], "empty": "plant_manual_valves holds ZERO rows for area 340. The table has 228 records in total, for areas 200 (124) and 330 (104) only. Every isolation, drain, vent, bypass, root and check valve on the compressor packages, the receiver and the condensers - the 341-HV / 341-MV / 341-HR / 341-CK series drawn on PR34-PR38 - is absent from the registry. No valve-lineup or LOTO exercise can be driven from data for this unit."}, "docs": {"title": "Documents · Unit 340 (11)", "cols": ["Doc", "Title", "Rev"], "rows": [["PRO13-ING-PR34", "21044-PR-PID-34001 - package PK-341-1 (C-341-1 + oil system)", "7"], ["PRO13-ING-PR35", "21044-PR-PID-34002 - package PK-341-2 (twin)", "1"], ["PRO13-ING-PR36", "21044-PR-PID-34003 - package PK-341-3 (twin)", "1"], ["PRO13-ING-PR37", "21044-PR-PID-34004 - package PK-341-4 (twin)", "1"], ["PRO13-ING-PR38", "21044-PR-PID-34005 - common system: V-343, E-342-1…6, suction and discharge headers", "7"], ["PRO02-ING-FR02", "Process description (manual Table 7.2 #1)", ""], ["PRO10-ING-PR07", "21044-PR-UFD-00001 - utility flow diagram, R1 refrigerant loop (Table 7.2 #2)", "3"], ["SAF01-ING-FR01", "Process safety and isolation philosophy (Table 7.2 #5)", ""], ["SAF12-ING-FR01", "Cause and effect matrix (Table 7.2 #6)", ""], ["SAF05-ING-FR01", "Relief and blowdown philosophy (Table 7.2 #7)", ""], ["21044-AU-HMI-00002", "HMI philosophy (Table 7.2 #8)", ""]], "foot": "Revisions come from plant_pid_drawings and v_doc_register_public: PR34 and PR38 rev 7, PR35/36/37 rev 1, all ISSUE FOR COMMISSIONING except PR38 (Approved for Construction, 3 Mar 2026). THE DATABASE IS ONE REVISION BEHIND ON PR38: it holds rev 7, while the drawing used to build this module is rev 8. The registry carries no issued revision for the process, safety and HMI documents. All five P&IDs have plant_documents.available = false, url = null and v_doc_register_public.registered = false - the PDFs are in the plant-docs bucket but not registered, which is why every row opens as pending."}};
  var CE340={"title": "Cause & Effect · Unit 340 (Manual Table 7.11 - the database holds NO C&E matrix for area 340)", "effects": [{"tag": "C-341-x", "action": "Trip", "desc": "Ammonia compressor of that package - stop"}, {"tag": "V-341-x", "action": "Trip", "desc": "Oil separator of that package - tripped with it"}, {"tag": "P-341-x", "action": "Trip", "desc": "Oil pump of that package - stop"}, {"tag": "E-341-x", "action": "Trip", "desc": "Oil cooler of that package - fans stop"}], "causes": [{"tag": "LSD01 / 03 / 05 / 07", "ins": "HS-3411.x-LSD", "ty": "LSD", "sp": "—", "ds": "PK-341-x emergency stop PUSH BUTTON on the local panel", "eff": ["C-341-x", "V-341-x", "P-341-x", "E-341-x"]}, {"tag": "LSD02 / 04 / 06 / 08", "ins": "PCS interlock", "ty": "LSD", "sp": "—", "ds": "PK-341-x emergency stop INTERLOCK", "eff": ["C-341-x", "V-341-x", "P-341-x", "E-341-x"]}, {"tag": "PAHH-3412.x", "ins": "PT-3412.x", "ty": "LSD", "sp": "27.5 barg", "ds": "C-341-x high high discharge pressure", "eff": ["C-341-x", "V-341-x", "P-341-x", "E-341-x"]}, {"tag": "PALL-3411.x", "ins": "PT-3411.x", "ty": "LSD", "sp": "1.5 bara", "ds": "C-341-x low low suction pressure", "eff": ["C-341-x", "V-341-x", "P-341-x", "E-341-x"]}, {"tag": "TAHH-3412.x", "ins": "TT-3412.x", "ty": "LSD", "sp": "110 °C", "ds": "C-341-x high high discharge temperature", "eff": ["C-341-x", "V-341-x", "P-341-x", "E-341-x"]}, {"tag": "PDALL-3414.x", "ins": "PDI-3414.x (calc)", "ty": "LSD", "sp": "1 bar", "ds": "C-341-x low low lube-oil differential pressure - NOT in Table 7.11. The measurement is CALCULATED in the PLC as PT-3413.x - PT-3412.x, so there is no instrument row to find; the alarm register calls it PDT-3414.x, which is a naming error", "eff": []}, {"tag": "TAHH-3418.x", "ins": "TT-3418.x", "ty": "LSD", "sp": "65 °C", "ds": "C-341-x high high oil header temperature - NOT in Table 7.11", "eff": []}, {"tag": "TAHH-3419.x", "ins": "TT-3419.x", "ty": "LSD", "sp": "—", "ds": "C-341-x high high suction temperature - NOT in Table 7.11, set point null in the registry", "eff": []}, {"tag": "XAHH-3401", "ins": "GD-05…GD-09 (2ooN)", "ty": "PSD", "sp": "DI", "ds": "Ammonia gas detection - effects not digitised anywhere", "eff": []}, {"tag": "PSD01", "ins": "—", "ty": "PSD", "sp": "—", "ds": "Loss of ammonia loop - Table 7.11 contains no row for it", "eff": []}], "note": "Source: operating manual Table 7.11. The database holds NO C&E records for area 340. ONE package is drawn because Table 7.11 is symmetric: the same five causes repeat on all four (LSD01/02 → PK-341-1 … LSD07/08 → PK-341-4) and each trips only its OWN package - tripping one train never stops the other three, which is the point of 3 working + 1 standby. FIVE ROWS HAVE NO EFFECT SIDE, on purpose: PDALL-3414.x, TAHH-3418.x and TAHH-3419.x are trips in Table 7.10 but carry no row in Table 7.11; XAHH-3401 and PSD01 have no effects recorded anywhere. Nothing has been guessed."};
  var DOCS103=[{"grp": "Process diagrams", "no": "PRO02-ING-FR02", "ttl": "Process Description - §7 is Unit 340 (manual Table 7.2 #1)", "rev": "", "url": null}, {"grp": "Process diagrams", "no": "PRO10-ING-PR07", "ttl": "21044-PR-UFD-00001 - Utility Flow Diagram, R1 refrigerant loop (Table 7.2 #2)", "rev": "3", "url": null}, {"grp": "P&ID - Unit 340", "no": "PRO13-ING-PR34", "ttl": "21044-PR-PID-34001 - package PK-341-1: C-341-1, V-341-1, F-341-1A/B, P-341-1, E-341-1, X-341-1 (Table 7.2 #3)", "rev": "7", "url": null}, {"grp": "P&ID - Unit 340", "no": "PRO13-ING-PR35", "ttl": "21044-PR-PID-34002 - package PK-341-2 (twin of PR34)", "rev": "1", "url": null}, {"grp": "P&ID - Unit 340", "no": "PRO13-ING-PR36", "ttl": "21044-PR-PID-34003 - package PK-341-3 (twin of PR34)", "rev": "1", "url": null}, {"grp": "P&ID - Unit 340", "no": "PRO13-ING-PR37", "ttl": "21044-PR-PID-34004 - package PK-341-4 (twin of PR34)", "rev": "1", "url": null}, {"grp": "P&ID - Unit 340", "no": "PRO13-ING-PR38", "ttl": "21044-PR-PID-34005 - common system: receiver V-343, condensers E-342-1…6, suction and discharge headers (Table 7.2 #4) · DB holds rev 7, this module was built from rev 8", "rev": "7", "url": null}, {"grp": "P&ID - R1 users & relief", "no": "PRO13-ING-PR08", "ttl": "21044-PR-PID-31001 - Unit 310 skid S-311/S-313, natural gas precooler E-311 (LIC-3111 / LV-3111, PCV-3101, PCV-3111)", "rev": "7", "url": null}, {"grp": "P&ID - R1 users & relief", "no": "PRO13-ING-PR22", "ttl": "21044-PR-PID-35010 - Unit 350 skid S-354, ammonia MR cooler E-354 (LIC-3540 / LV-3540, PT-3552 / PIC-3552)", "rev": "8", "url": null}, {"grp": "P&ID - R1 users & relief", "no": "PRO13-ING-PR43", "ttl": "Ammonia / flare header - destination of every unit-340 relief line", "rev": "", "url": null}, {"grp": "Safety", "no": "SAF01-ING-FR01", "ttl": "Process Safety & Isolation Philosophy (Table 7.2 #5)", "rev": "", "url": null}, {"grp": "Safety", "no": "SAF12-ING-FR01", "ttl": "Cause & Effect Matrix (Table 7.2 #6) - holds no records for area 340", "rev": "", "url": null}, {"grp": "Safety", "no": "SAF05-ING-FR01", "ttl": "Relief & Blowdown Philosophy (Table 7.2 #7)", "rev": "", "url": null}, {"grp": "Operations", "no": "21044-AU-HMI-00002", "ttl": "HMI Philosophy (Table 7.2 #8)", "rev": "", "url": null}, {"grp": "Operations", "no": "21044-PR-MAN-00001", "ttl": "Plant Operating Manual - Ch. 7 is Unit 340 (Tables 7.2 to 7.14)", "rev": "", "url": null}, {"grp": "HSE", "no": "NH3 MSDS", "ttl": "Ammonia - Material Safety Data Sheet", "rev": "", "url": null}, {"grp": "HSE", "no": "TAM-158 NH3 HSE", "ttl": "TAM-158 - Ammonia HSE training package", "rev": "", "url": null}];
