ace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="400" fill="#15171A">3411.1</text></g><text x="790" y="88" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.0" fill="#8B939C">disch. P</text><text x="846" y="88" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.0" fill="#8B939C">disch. T</text><text x="902" y="88" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.0" fill="#8B939C">suct. P</text><text x="858" y="134" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="700" fill="#C8102E">THE FOUR TRIPS ON THIS MACHINE</text><text x="858" y="145" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" fill="#4A4F57">PAHH-3412.1 &#183; 27.5 barg</text><text x="858" y="154" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" fill="#4A4F57">TAHH-3412.1 &#183; 110 &#176;C</text><text x="858" y="163" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" fill="#4A4F57">PALL-3411.1 &#183; 1.5 bara</text><text x="858" y="172" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" fill="#4A4F57">PDALL-3414.1 &#183; oil &#916;P 1 bar</text><text x="858" y="184" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" font-weight="700" fill="#4A4F57">each one stops C-341-1, V-341-1,</text><text x="858" y="193" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" font-weight="700" fill="#4A4F57">P-341-1 and E-341-1 together</text><line x1="14" y1="224" x2="986" y2="224" stroke="#D6DAE0" stroke-width=".8"/><text x="14" y="238" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" fill="#4A4F57">One of FOUR identical trains &#183; PRO13-ING-PR34 / PR35 / PR36 / PR37 &#183; TT-3419.1 also watches the suction temperature &#183; the oil system is on the next drawing</text></svg>',
    oil: '<svg viewBox="0 0 1000 306" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><text x="14" y="14" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="7" font-weight="700" fill="#C8102E">TWO independent circuits leave the oil separator and pass through the SAME cooler &#8212; only the second one is pumped</text><text x="14" y="25" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" fill="#8B939C">PRO13-ING-PR34 sheet 2, Note 1 &#183; V-341-1 is both the separator and the oil reservoir</text><g data-eq="E-341-1"><rect x="456" y="58" width="132" height="138" rx="5" fill="#fff" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><ellipse cx="482.4" cy="57" rx="9.0" ry="3.4" fill="#fff" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="482.4" y1="53" x2="482.4" y2="61" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><ellipse cx="508.8" cy="57" rx="9.0" ry="3.4" fill="#fff" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="508.8" y1="53" x2="508.8" y2="61" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><ellipse cx="535.2" cy="57" rx="9.0" ry="3.4" fill="#fff" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="535.2" y1="53" x2="535.2" y2="61" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><ellipse cx="561.6" cy="57" rx="9.0" ry="3.4" fill="#fff" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="561.6" y1="53" x2="561.6" y2="61" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><text x="522.0" y="120.0" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="8.6" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A" text-anchor="middle" class="tagtx">E-341-1</text><text x="522.0" y="131.0" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" font-weight="700" fill="#4A4F57" text-anchor="middle" class="subtx">OIL COOLER</text><text x="522.0" y="140.0" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" fill="#4A4F57" text-anchor="middle" class="subtx">338 kW &#183; 10 fans &#215; 4 kW</text></g><rect x="12.0" y="75.5" width="92" height="17" rx="3" fill="#fff" stroke="#4A4F57" stroke-width="1.3"/><text x="58" y="87.6" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-