d"/><text x="0" y="-2.2" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="7.4" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">PDG</text><text x="0" y="6.4" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="400" fill="#15171A">3414.1</text></g><path d="M 695,153 L 695,164" fill="none" stroke="#8B939C" stroke-width="1.1"/><g transform="translate(620,128)"><title>TT-3418.1 &#183; oil to the compressor &#183; trip 65 &#176;C</title><circle cx="0" cy="0" r="11" fill="#fff" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="0" y="-2.2" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="7.4" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">TT</text><text x="0" y="6.4" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="400" fill="#15171A">3418.1</text></g><text x="646" y="112" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.1" font-weight="700" fill="#4A4F57">oil temperature after the cooler</text><text x="646" y="121" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.0" fill="#8B939C">HIGH-HIGH 65 &#176;C trips the machine</text><line x1="14" y1="238" x2="986" y2="238" stroke="#D6DAE0" stroke-width=".8"/><text x="14" y="252" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.8" font-weight="700" fill="#C8102E">WHAT THE CONTROL SYSTEM WATCHES ON THE OIL</text><g transform="translate(66,278)"><title>PDI-3414.1 &#183; oil differential pressure &#183; COMPUTED in the PLC as PT-3413.1 &#8722; PT-3412.1 &#8212; not a field device</title><rect x="-11" y="-11" width="22" height="22" fill="#fff" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="0" cy="0" r="10.6" fill="none" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="-11" y1="0" x2="11" y2="0" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="0" y="-2.2" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="7.4" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">PDI</text><text x="0" y="6.4" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="400" fill="#15171A">3414.1</text></g><text x="66" y="300" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" font-weight="700" fill="#C8102E">OIL &#916;P &#183; CALCULATED</text><g transform="translate(150,278)"><title>LSL-3417.1 &#183; V-341-1 low oil level</title><circle cx="0" cy="0" r="11" fill="#fff" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="0" y="-2.2" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="7.4" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">LSL</text><text x="0" y="6.4" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="400" fill="#15171A">3417.1</text></g><text x="150" y="300" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" font-weight="700" fill="#4A4F57">OIL LEVEL</text><g transform="translate(234,278)"><title>PT-3413.1 &#183; oil header pressure &#183; 0..34.47 barg</title><circle cx="0" cy="0" r="11" fill="#fff" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="0" y="-2.2" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="7.4" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">PT</text><text x="0" y="6.4" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="400" fill="#15171A">3413.1</text></g><text x="234" y="300" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" font-weight="700" fill="#4A4F57">HEADER P</text><g transform="translate(318,278)"><title>TT-3417.1 &#183; separator oil temperature</title><circle cx="0" cy="0" r="11" fill="#fff" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="0" y="-2.2" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="7.4" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">TT</text><text x="0" y="6.4" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="400" fill="#15171A">3417.1</text></g><text x="318" y="300" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" font-weight="700" fill="#4A4F57">OIL TEMP</text><text x="380" y="268" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" font-weight="700" fill="#4A4F57">PDI-3414.1 = PT-3413.1 &#8722; PT-3412.1, CALCULATED in the PLC &#8212; always above 1.5 bar D. Alarm 1.5 / trip 1 bar in the register.</text><text x="380" y="278" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" fill="#8B939C">PDCV-3417.1 regulates the pump differential by recycling to separator nozzle N4 &#183; PG-3415.1 / PG-3417.1 read it locally, either side of the PDCV.</text><text x="380" y="288" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" fill="#8B939C">Filter &#916;P is a LOCAL gauge only (PDG-3414.1) &#8212; nobody in the control room sees a blocking filter. It is a FIELD check.</text><text x="380" y="300" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" fill="#8B939C">X-341-1A/B/C oil heater, 5.3 kW, is energised only while the compressor is STOPPED, so the oil is warm enough to start.</text></svg>',
