y="203.6" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="7.4" font-weight="700" fill="#B26A00" text-anchor="middle">E-311</text><rect x="704.0" y="236.5" width="44" height="15" rx="3" fill="#fff" stroke="#B26A00" stroke-width="1.3"/><text x="726" y="247.6" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="7.4" font-weight="700" fill="#B26A00" text-anchor="middle">E-354</text><text x="756" y="203" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" fill="#8B939C">1&#189;&quot;-AN-000208-3L1 &#8594; PCV-3111 (SET 4 barg)</text><text x="756" y="247" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" fill="#8B939C">3&quot;-AN-000125-3L1 &#8594; PCV-3540 (SET 2.8 barg)</text><line x1="14" y1="256" x2="986" y2="256" stroke="#D6DAE0" stroke-width=".8"/><text x="14" y="270" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="7.4" font-weight="700" fill="#C8102E">THE PRESSURE LADDER &#8212; every set point on the high-pressure side, in order</text><line x1="120" y1="302" x2="880" y2="302" stroke="#4A4F57" stroke-width="1.4"/><line x1="120.0" y1="296" x2="120.0" y2="308" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.6"/><text x="120.0" y="292" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">20 barg</text><line x1="120.0" y1="308" x2="120.0" y2="310" stroke="#D6DAE0" stroke-width=".9"/><text x="120.0" y="318" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" fill="#4A4F57">PAL-3401 &#183; receiver low alarm</text><line x1="246.7" y1="296" x2="246.7" y2="308" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.6"/><text x="246.7" y="292" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">24.7 barg</text><line x1="246.7" y1="308" x2="246.7" y2="310" stroke="#D6DAE0" stroke-width=".9"/><text x="246.7" y="318" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" fill="#4A4F57">PCV-3402 &#183; hot gas to the receiver</text><line x1="373.3" y1="296" x2="373.3" y2="308" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.6"/><text x="373.3" y="292" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">25 barg</text><line x1="373.3" y1="308" x2="373.3" y2="322" stroke="#D6DAE0" stroke-width=".9"/><text x="373.3" y="330" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" fill="#4A4F57">PIC-3401 set point &#183; fan staging</text><line x1="500.0" y1="296" x2="500.0" y2="308" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.6"/><text x="500.0" y="292" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">25.45 barg</text><line x1="500.0" y1="308" x2="500.0" y2="334" stroke="#D6DAE0" stroke-width=".9"/><text x="500.0" y="342" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" fill="#4A4F57">PCV-3401 &#183; discharge control</text><line x1="626.7" y1="296" x2="626.7" y2="308" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.6"/><text x="626.7" y="292" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">27 barg</text><line x1="626.7" y1="308" x2="626.7" y2="310" stroke="#D6DAE0" stroke-width=".9"/><text x="626.7" y="318" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" fill="#4A4F57">PAH-3401 &#183; receiver high alarm</text><line x1="753.3" y1="296" x2="753.3" y2="308" stroke="#C8102E" stroke-width="1.6"/><text x="753.3" y="292" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" font-weight="700" fill="#C8102E">27.5 barg</text><line x1="753.3" y1="308" x2="753.3" y2="322" stroke="#D6DAE0" stroke-width=".9"/><text x="753.3" y="330" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" font-weight="700" fill="#C8102E">PAHH-3412.x &#183; compressor TRIP</text><line x1="880.0" y1="296" x2="880.0" y2="308" stroke="#C8102E" stroke-width="1.6"/><text x="880.0" y="292" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" font-weight="700" fill="#C8102E">28 barg</text><line x1="880.0" y1="308" x2="880.0" y2="334" stroke="#D6DAE0" stroke-width=".9"/><text x="880.0" y="342" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" font-weight="700" fill="#C8102E">PSV-3401A/B &#183; RELIEF VALVES LIFT</text><text x="986" y="358" text-anchor="end" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.1" fill="#8B939C">the ticks are in ORDER, not to scale</text><text x="14" y="358" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" fill="#4A4F57">PR38 rev 8 traced: both valves are fed from the compressor discharge; PCV-3402 delivers into V-343 nozzle N2, the VAPOUR space. Head-pressure duty is the reading of the drawing, not manual text.</text></svg>',
    relief: '<svg viewBox="0 0 1000 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g data-run="FL"><polyline points="900,34 150,34" fill="none" stroke="#8B939C" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linejoin="round" marker-end="url(#a8B939C)"/></g><polygon points="148,18.0 28,18.0 14,34 28,50.0 148,50.0" fill="#fff" stroke="#8B939C" stroke-width="1.3"/><text x="141" y="33" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A" text-anchor="end">U230</text><text x="141" y="44" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.8" fill="#4A4F57" text-anchor="end">ammonia flare header</text><text x="540" y="22" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="700" fill="#C8102E">3&quot;-FL-000026-1C1 &#8594; PRO13-ING-PR43 &#183; AMMONIA IS FLARED ONLY IN AN EMERGENCY</text><g data-eq="V-343"><rect x="110" y="176" width="190" height="40" rx="20.0" ry="20.0" fill="#fff" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><text x="205.0" y="195.0" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A" text-anchor="middle" class="tagtx">V-343</text><text x="205.0" y="205.0" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" font-weight="700" fill="#4A4F57" text-anchor="middle" class="subtx">RECEIVER</text></g><g data-run="V1"><polyline points="205,176 205,146" fill="none" stroke="#8B939C" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g data-eq="COV-3401"><g class="vlv" data-vtag="COV-3401" data-vkind="ONOFF_VALVE" transform="translate(205,136)"><path d="M -9,-6.5 L -9,6.5 L 0,0 Z" fill="#fff" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M 9,-6.5 L 9,6.5 L 0,0 Z" fill="#fff" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="-11" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="-6" y="-18.5" width="12" height="7.5" fill="#fff" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="-6" y1="-11" x2="6" y2="-18.5" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></g></g><text x="226" y="140" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" font-weight="700" fill="#4A4F57">COV-3401 &#183; change-over, LOCKED</text><path d="M 205,118 L 170,104 M 205,118 L 240,104" fill="none" stroke="#8B939C" stroke-width="1.8"/><g class="vlv" data-vtag="PSV-3401A" data-vkind="SHUTDOWN_VALVE" transform="translate(170,96)"><path d="M -9,-6.5 L -9,6.5 L 0,0 Z" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M 9,-6.5 L 9,6.5 L 0,0 Z" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="-11" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="-6" y="-18.5" width="12" height="7.5" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="-6" y1="-11" x2="6" y2="-18.5" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><g class="vlv" data-vtag="PSV-3401B" data-vkind="SHUTDOWN_VALVE" transform="translate(240,96)"><path d="M -9,-6.5 L -9,6.5 L 0,0 Z" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M 9,-6.5 L 9,6.5 L 0,0 Z" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="-11" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="-6" y="-18.5" width="12" height="7.5" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="-6" y1="-11" x2="6" y2="-18.5" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><g data-run="V4"><polyline points="170,74 170,34" fill="none" stroke="#8B939C" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g data-run="V5"><polyline points="240,74 240,34" fill="none" stroke="#8B939C" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><text x="14" y="236" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.8" font-weight="700" fill="#8A6D00">PSV-3401A / PSV-3401B &#183; 28 barg &#183; FIRE CASE</text><text x="14" y="247" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" fill="#4A4F57">one duty, one standby, on a change-over valve with a LOCK device</text><text x="14" y="257" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" font-weight="700" fill="#4A4F57">&#8212; you can never isolate both of them at the same time</text><text x="14" y="271" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" fill="#8B939C">1&#189;&quot;-FL-340002-3L1 &#8594; 3&quot;-FL-340003-1C1 &#8594; 3&quot;-FL-000026-1C1</text><text x="14" y="281" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" fill="#8B939C">a 3&quot; branch off the V-343 inlet downcomer also runs to the flare header</text><line x1="330" y1="60" x2="330" y2="290" stroke="#D6DAE0" stroke-width="1"/><text x="352" y="74" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.8" font-weight="700" fill="#C8102E">ON EACH OF THE FOUR COMPRESSOR PACKAGES</text><g class="vlv" data-vtag="PSV-3411.x" data-vkind="SHUTDOWN_VALVE" transform="translate(374,116)"><path d="M -9,-6.5 L -9,6.5 L 0,0 Z" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M 9,-6.5 L 9,6.5 L 0,0 Z" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="-11" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="-6" y="-18.5" width="12" height="7.5" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="-6" y1="-11" x2="6" y2="-18.5" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><text x="404" y="110" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.8" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">PSV-3411.x</text><text x="404" y="120" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" fill="#4A4F57">C-341-x blocked outlet</text><text x="404" y="130" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" font-weight="700" fill="#8A6D00">set 28 barg</text><g data-run="pk0"><polyline points="374,96 374,96 560,96 560,38" fill="none" stroke="#8B939C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g class="vlv" data-vtag="PSV-3417.xA/B" data-vkind="SHUTDOWN_VALVE" transform="translate(374,172)"><path d="M -9,-6.5 L -9,6.5 L 0,0 Z" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M 9,-6.5 L 9,6.5 L 0,0 Z" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="-11" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="-6" y="-18.5" width="12" height="7.5" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="-6" y1="-11" x2="6" y2="-18.5" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><text x="404" y="166" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.8" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">PSV-3417.xA/B</text><text x="404" y="176" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" fill="#4A4F57">V-341-x oil separator</text><text x="404" y="186" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" font-weight="700" fill="#8A6D00">set 28 barg</text><g data-run="pk1"><polyline points="374,152 374,96 560,96 560,38" fill="none" stroke="#8B939C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g class="vlv" data-vtag="PSV-3418.x" data-vkind="SHUTDOWN_VALVE" transform="translate(374,228)"><path d="M -9,-6.5 L -9,6.5 L 0,0 Z" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M 9,-6.5 L 9,6.5 L 0,0 Z" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="-11" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="-6" y="-18.5" width="12" height="7.5" fill="#F7C600" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="-6" y1="-11" x2="6" y2="-18.5" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><text x="404" y="222" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.8" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">PSV-3418.x</text><text x="404" y="232" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" fill="#4A4F57">P-341-x oil pump</text><text x="404" y="242" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" font-weight="700" fill="#8A6D00">set 6 bar differential</text><g data-run="pk2"><polyline points="374,208 374,96 560,96 560,38" fill="none" stroke="#8B939C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><text x="352" y="288" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" fill="#8B939C">1&#189;&quot;-FL-34x123-1C1, one per package &#183; 18 relief-valve records in total</text><line x1="616" y1="60" x2="616" y2="290" stroke="#D6DAE0" stroke-width="1"/><text x="638" y="74" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.8" font-weight="700" fill="#C8102E">VENTS &#183; DRAINS &#183; CHARGING</text><text x="638" y="104" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">340-HV-026</text><text x="758" y="104" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" fill="#4A4F57">V-343 bottom drain &#183; 2&quot; on nozzle D1</text><text x="638" y="126" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">340-HV-030</text><text x="758" y="126" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" fill="#4A4F57">1&#189;&quot; drain on the receiver top connections</text><text x="638" y="148" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">340-HV-002 / -006</text><text x="758" y="148" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" fill="#4A4F57">3&quot; outlet block valves, one per PSV</text><text x="638" y="170" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">340-CK-081</text><text x="758" y="170" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" fill="#4A4F57">6&quot; check valve, condensers &#8594; V-343</text><text x="638" y="192" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">354-HV-201</text><text x="758" y="192" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" fill="#4A4F57">1&#189;&quot; REFRIGERANT CHARGING POINT</text><text x="638" y="214" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">340-HV-008 / -010</text><text x="758" y="214" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" fill="#4A4F57">&#189;&quot; drains either side of PCV-3401</text><text x="638" y="236" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">340-HV-013 / -014</text><text x="758" y="236" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" fill="#4A4F57">8&quot; isolation around PCV-3401</text><text x="638" y="258" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">340-HV-029</text><text x="758" y="258" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" fill="#4A4F57">6&quot; receiver liquid outlet isolation</text><text x="638" y="288" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" font-weight="700" fill="#C8102E">Every drain and vent on this unit releases AMMONIA. None of them is a routine operator task.</text></svg>',
    valves340: '<svg viewBox="0 0 1000 296" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;"><line x1="0" y1="12" x2="1000" y2="12" stroke="#D6DAE0" stroke-width="1"/><text x="0" y="22" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="8" font-weight="700" fill="#8A6D00">RELIEF &#183; the ONLY automatic protection against overpressure</text><text x="1000" y="22" text-anchor="end" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" fill="#8B939C">18 records &#183; all to the ammonia flare header &#183; none of them vents to atmosphere</text><g class="vlv" data-vtag="PSV-3401A/B" data-vkind="RELIEF_VALVE" transform="translate(50,50)"><title>PSV-3401A/B &#8212; V-343 &#183; 28 barg</title><path d="M -6.5,9 L 6.5,9 L 0,0 Z" fill="#fff" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M 9,-6.5 L 9,6.5 L 0,0 Z" fill="#fff" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="-8" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M -4,-8 L 4,-10 L -4,-12 L 4,-14 L -4,-16" fill="none" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><text x="50" y="68" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.9" font-weight="700" fill="#4A4F57">PSV-3401A/B</text><text x="50" y="77" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.1" fill="#8B939C">V-343 &#183; 28 barg</text><g class="vlv" data-vtag="PSV-3411.1" data-vkind="RELIEF_VALVE" transform="translate(150,50)"><title>PSV-3411.1 &#8212; C-341-1 &#183; 28</title><path d="M -6.5,9 L 6.5,9 L 0,0 Z" fill="#fff" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M 9,-6.5 L 9,6.5 L 0,0 Z" fill="#fff" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="-8" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M -4,-8 L 4,-10 L -4,-12 L 4,-14 L -4,-16" fill="none" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><text x="150" 