412.1 &#183; LSD</title><path d="M 0,-14 L 14,0 L 0,14 L -14,0 Z" fill="#fff" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="0" cy="0" r="10.4" fill="none" stroke="#8A6D00" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="0" y="-2.2" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="7.4" font-weight="700" fill="#8A6D00">TT</text><text x="0" y="6.4" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="400" fill="#8A6D00">3412.1</text></g><text x="410" y="304" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.3" fill="#8B939C">diamond &#8212; shutdown logic</text><path d="M 520,272 L 576,272" fill="none" stroke="#4A4F57" stroke-width="1.15" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M-4.5,-3 L1,0 L-4.5,3 Z" fill="#4A4F57" transform="translate(576,272)"/><text x="582" y="275" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.5" fill="#4A4F57">process tap &#8212; a pipe to the sensor</text><path d="M 520,288 L 576,288" fill="none" stroke="#4A4F57" stroke-width="1.15" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/><g transform="translate(548.0,288)"><circle cx="-4" cy="0" r="1.9" fill="#fff" stroke="#4A4F57" stroke-width="1.15"/><circle cx="4" cy="0" r="1.9" fill="#fff" stroke="#4A4F57" stroke-width="1.15"/></g><path d="M-4.5,-3 L1,0 L-4.5,3 Z" fill="#4A4F57" transform="translate(576,288)"/><text x="582" y="291" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.5" fill="#4A4F57">software link &#8212; inside the PCS there is NO cable</text><path d="M 520,304 L 576,304" fill="none" stroke="#4A4F57" stroke-width="1.15" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="5 3"/><path d="M-4.5,-3 L1,0 L-4.5,3 Z" fill="#4A4F57" transform="translate(576,304)"/><text x="582" y="307" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.5" fill="#4A4F57">electric 4-20 mA &#183; 230 VAC to the solenoids</text><text x="0" y="318" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.1" fill="#8B939C">Every compressor carries the SAME eight analogue points, so a value that looks wrong on one train can always be compared against three identical neighbours &#183; PDI-3414.x, the oil &#916;P that trips the machine, is CALCULATED from PT-3413.x &#8722; PT-3412.x &#8212; no device row, by design.</text></svg>',
    loops340: '<svg viewBox="0 0 1000 330" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;"><text x="18" y="40" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="7.6" font-weight="700" fill="#C8102E">PIC-3401</text><text x="18" y="50" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.4" fill="#4A4F57">V-343 receiver pressure</text><text x="18" y="59" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.2" fill="#8B939C">0..28 barg &#183; SP 25 barg</text><g transform="translate(40,80)"><title>PT-3401 &#183; PCS</title><circle cx="0" cy="0" r="11" fill="#fff" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="0" y="-2.2" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="7.4" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">PT</text><text x="0" y="6.4" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="400" fill="#15171A">3401</text></g><path d="M 52,80 L 136,80" fill="none" stroke="#4A4F57" stroke-width="1.15" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M-4.5,-3 L1,0 L-4.5,3 Z" fill="#4A4F57" transform="translate(136,80)"/><g transform="translate(150,80)"><title>PIC-3401 &#183; PCS controller</title><rect x="-11" y="-11" width="22" height="22" fill="#fff" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="0" cy="0" r="10.6" fill="none" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="-11" y1="0" x2="11" y2="0" stroke="#15171A" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="0" y="-2.2" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="7.4" font-weight="700" fill="#15171A">PIC</text><text x="0" y="6.4" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Consolas,monospace" font-size="6.6" font-weight="400" fill="#15171A">3401</text></g><path d="M 164,80 L 226,80" fill="none" stroke="#4A4F57" stroke-width="1.15" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="5 3"/><path d="M-4.5,-3 L1,0 L-4.5,3 Z" fill="#4A4F57" transform="translate(